Description: Implements two-phase failure-time-auxiliary-dependent sampling and a
    plug-in semiparametric pseudo-likelihood estimator for right-censored Cox
    regression with expensive covariates measured on a validation subsample.
    Includes cohort bootstrap inference and simulation-based examples.
